# Vocabulary and location tags

## Roles

- **Architect / Orchestrator** — plans, contracts, routing (Claude, etc.)
- **Engineer** — implementation (Cursor)

## Location tags (required on multi-step instructions)

| Tag | Meaning |
|-----|---------|
| `[local-tree]` | Files on your machine in the repo |
| `[local-repo]` | Git history and branches (no network) |
| `[github]` | Remote on github.com |
| `[-local env]` | Dev runtime on your machine |
| `[-staging env]` | Staging cloud/host |
| `[-prod env]` | Production — human gate required |

## Disambiguation

- **merge** — say `[local-repo]` git merge vs `[github]` PR merge
- **push** — git push vs container image push
- **staging** — git staged files vs `[-staging env]`
